t let this opportunity pass.""\n\nIn this scenario, the initial choice to surrender anchors players\' decision-making, making it more likely that they will choose to continue fighting when presented with the Harmonium artifact, even though there may be other factors to consider. This demonstrates the power of temporal anchoring in strategic decision-making and its potential impact on player behavior in Harmonia Chronicles.'}]",,
